  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida&apos;s grant to IFRC through the Swedish Red Cross is expected to contribute towards saving thousands of lives and protecting  livelihoods from health crises and disasters in vulnerable communities world-wide. This will be done by strengthening capacities among partners within the RC/RC Movement to mitigate, prepare for and respond to disasters, an deliver critical social and health services.</narrative>
